# Security headers for Cloudflare (Workers static assets read this file).
#
# frame-ancestors: only ChalkBored (chalkbored.win and its Vercel and workers.dev
#   copies) may put Tide in a frame (Chalk TV and
#   Chalk Browser). Opening Tide on its own still works.
# nosniff: browsers don't guess file types.
# Referrer-Policy: sites opened in Tide never learn Tide's address.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self' https://chalkbored.win https://chalkbored-for-students.vercel.app https://chalkbored.guernica4u.workers.dev
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
